sed -i '978i \                self.state.cur_iter += 1' 
src/agentscope/agent/_agent.py

# add cur_iter increment in _next_action before returning Reasoning
sed -i '/return Reasoning(/i \        self.state.cur_iter += 1' 
src/agentscope/agent/_agent.py
```

